    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Usage </strong>etched onto a weapon without a rune with the positive trait.</p>\n<p>Runechill weapons are cold to the touch and flicker with a cold blue light. Runechill weapons deal an additional 1d6 negative damage to living creatures. Undead creatures do not receive healing from this negative damage, but must instead make a fortitude save equal to the wielder's class DC or become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Flat-Footed} for 1 round. On a critical failure, the target is also fleeing for 1 round unless it suceeds at a will save.</p>",
